Package: ExpectSEE
Title: Estimating Systems of Equations for Expectiles
Version: 0.2.11
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hui-Ching", "Chuang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hcchuang@mail.ntpu.edu.tw"),
    person("O-Chia", "Chuang", role = "aut"),
    person("Zaichao", "Du", role = "aut")
  )
Author: Hui-Ching Chuang, O-Chia Chuang, Zaichao Du
Maintainer: Hui-Ching Chuang <hcchuang@mail.ntpu.edu.tw>
Description: Estimation of systems of equations for expectiles using
    system asymmetric least squares and its feasible generalized extension,
    with direct-LASSO high-dimensional counterparts. Provides generated-regressor
    covariance, fixed-dimensional specification and linear-restriction tests,
    expanding-window penalty selection, and model-implied impulse responses
    for expectiles. Includes a self-contained synthetic-data example for the
    companion working paper.
URL: https://github.com/hcchuang/ExpectSEE
